---
/**
 * Mount point for the animated logo. A page script calls mountLogo() on the element with data-logo.
 * The size comes from --logo-size, which the page sets (and can change per breakpoint); the box is
 * always square and never wider than its container.
 */
---
<div class="logo" data-logo></div>

<style>
  .logo {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: var(--logo-size, min(60vmin, 520px));
    max-width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  }
</style>
